{"asset_key":"ep1/quest_story_11113180","episode":"ep1","category":"quest_story","story_id":"11113180","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:2:1111318001:0":{"text":"그 피리는 당장 버려야 해! 아주 위험하다구!","source_cn":"扔掉那个笛子！很危险！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x10E48717A6F0A541","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1111318002:0":{"text":"안돼! 이건 내 보물이야! 이게 없으면 엄마 아빠랑 다시는 이야기할 수 없어!","source_cn":"不能扔！这是我的宝物！没了它，我再也不能和爸爸妈妈说话了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x135E4B3DB12C027B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1111318003:1":{"text":"이건 그냥 피리야. 근데 어떻게 이걸로 돌아가신 분들과 대화한다는 거야?","source_cn":"那是个笛子，你要怎么用它和去世的人说话呀！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8155DD8E95F45056","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1111318004:0":{"text":"왜 못해? 피리를 불면 엄마 아빠의 목소리를 들을 수 있단 말이야!","source_cn":"怎么不能！只要用它吹响旋律，就能听见爸爸妈妈的声音！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5FCAD6A62D67FEA6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1111318005:0":{"text":"언닌 역시 나쁜 사람이야! 안탄드라 언니도 빼앗아 가는 것도 모자라서 이젠 내 피리까지 빼앗으려고 하잖아!","source_cn":"你果然很坏！你抢我的安丹姐姐，还要抢我的笛子！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x70FD4E8277893B7F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1111318006:0":{"text":"왜 이렇게 억지를 부려? 이건 다 널 위해서 그런 거야!","source_cn":"你这小孩讲不讲理？我是为你好！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x51C6387B8E5612AC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1111318007:0":{"text":"사트라나, 진정하세요. 피리 안에 숨은 몬스터가 사라지면서 피리도 이미 정상으로 돌아온 게 느껴져요.","source_cn":"萨忒娜，冷静。那个藏在笛子中的魔物被消灭后，这笛子已经...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFF9F71BBB976B034","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1111318008:0":{"text":"카이, 혹시 이 피리... 부모님께서 남겨주신 유품이니?","source_cn":"卡卡，这笛子是你父母留给你的遗物吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF6B1E892AFDEC77A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1111318009:0":{"text":"아니... 주운 거야.","source_cn":"不……是我捡的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB9CE9721EFADD7D2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1111318010:0":{"text":"어디서?","source_cn":"在哪捡的？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x40FA8F075BE0FED3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1111318011:0":{"text":"여기서 아주 멀어. 크림슨 고원...","source_cn":"在深红高原深处，离这里很远。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCFEF9B86826BD879","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1111318012:0":{"text":"지난번에 거기로 놀러 갔을 때 주웠어. 분명 석양의 신이 주신 선물일 거야.","source_cn":"前阵子我跑去那边玩，捡到了这个，这一定是残阳神送给我的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD694CC6BA919A65A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1111318013:0":{"text":"거긴 석양의 신께서 잠든 곳과 가깝거든. 내가 엄마 아빠를 그리워한다는 걸 석양의 신께서 아시고... 선물로 주신 거야.","source_cn":"因为，那边距离残阳神睡觉的地方不远。残阳神知道，我想爸...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x488F13F857155BF4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1111318014:0":{"text":"혼자서 거길 갔다고? 간도 크네.","source_cn":"你一个人去那？胆子不小。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3B86D346BE8FB61E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1111318015:0":{"text":"카이가 말한 곳은 석양의 신이 잠든 곳일 거야.","source_cn":"卡卡说的，应该是残阳神的长眠之地。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA3F811779F5C3744","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1111318016:0":{"text":"거긴 석양의 신이 영면에 든 성지거든.","source_cn":"那是残阳神的陨落之处，是圣地。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x359E0E609B332A51","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1111318017:0":{"text":"카이가 왜 하필 거기서 사악한 힘이 깃든 피리를 줍게 된 걸까? 뭔가 수상한데...","source_cn":"卡卡怎么会在那捡到这样邪恶的笛子？太蹊跷了……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7525F00F8EEA4AB4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:25:1111318018:2":{"text":"윽...","source_cn":"呃……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC9731CDFA32A1DD7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:27:1111318019:0":{"text":"사트라나, 괜찮아?","source_cn":"萨忒娜，你还好吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA2387876E97EF648","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:28:1111318020:2":{"text":"<sad>붉... 은... 어... 둠...</sad>","source_cn":"<sad>深……红……幽……暗……</sad>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD98FD177EBBEC4DB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:30:1111318021:0":{"text":"사트라나가 예언을 하고 있어요!","source_cn":"萨忒娜在预言！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4BAC51D00892903A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:32:1111318022:2":{"text":"...거... 검붉은 곳에서... 가장 어두운... 곳으로...","source_cn":"……于……至高深红之所……去……至暗幽深之处……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x09D3A653432FE142","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:33:1111318023:0":{"text":"어둠이... 무덤을 덮을 것이다...","source_cn":"黑暗……即将笼罩墓穴……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6FE3B0F3FAD7029A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:34:1111318024:0":{"text":"그 그림자의 주인은...","source_cn":"而那身影……属于……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0A93102BFE0A11AE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:35:1111318025:1":{"text":"악마...!","source_cn":"恶魔！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x95961EFA8BE2CE70","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:37:1111318026:0":{"text":"!","source_cn":"！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4E87F6ABB60A7CEB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:38:1111318027:0":{"text":"윽... 머리야... 제가 방금... 또 뭐라고 한 거죠?","source_cn":"呜……头好晕……我刚刚……肯定又说了什么吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x55B938E1C71792D0